 "stimulus_html": "Without graphing the equations, answer questions 2 – 5 to complete the table.\n<table border=\"1\" class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th style=\"text-align: center;\">Equation</th>\n    <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-intercepts</th>\n    <th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span>-coordinate of vertex</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-math=\"y = x^2 + 12x\">y = x^2 + 12x</span></td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">2a. _____</td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">2b. _____</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-math=\"y = x^2 - 3x\">y = x^2 - 3x</span></td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">3a. _____</td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">3b. _____</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-math=\"y = -x^2 + 16x\">y = -x^2 + 16x</span></td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">4a. _____</td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">4b. _____</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-math=\"y = -x^2 - 24x\">y = -x^2 - 24x</span></td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">5a. _____</td>\n    <td style=\"text-align: center;\">5b. _____</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>",
